twinapi.appcore: implement Windows.ApplicationModel.DataTransfer.SharedStorageAccessManager

Implement Windows.ApplicationModel.DataTransfer.SharedStorageAccessManager
in twinapi.appcore, with the interfaces and runtime class it needs in the
WinRT headers and its registration in wine.inf. A running Affinity asks for
it when a second instance hands it a file. Not yet tested against that case
on 11.19; the widl and include/Makefile.in parts of the 11.18 version are
already in this set and were left out.
